
# clock discipline (operator line, outside managed blocks) — these containers run
# init.sh with no systemd/ntpd/chrony, and on 2026-09-14 every fleet box was
# 66-464s SLOW. A slow clock hands out App tokens GitHub has already expired and
# skews every age comparison the box makes. No-op when an NTP daemon is running;
# off via CLOCK_SYNC=0 or flags/clock-sync-off.
*/30 * * * * /root/harness/bin/clock-sync.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
